{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"pheasant","model_identifier":"pheasant","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# pheasant\n\nPheasant (Patch 5): a cock pheasant, made from `chicken_rooster`.\n\nA copper-bronze body with dark scale bars, chestnut wings, a dark green glossy head with red face wattles and a white neck ring, and a very long barred tail stepped back and up. Every rooster bone, pivot and clip is kept.\n\n- Cubes: 28. Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4..4, y 0..16, z -8..22 u.\n- Clips: `idle`, `walk`, `run`, `peck`, `flap`, `sit`, `injured`, `death`.\n\n## Clips (Patch 5 addition)\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `mate` | 2.0 | loop | Patch 5: a gentle nuzzle toward the partner on the model's left (head and neck turn, body sway, tail wag; birds fluff their wings, the hare hops), played by two animals side by side while the game draws hearts over them. |"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"flat_body#a8561f","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.2,5,-3.5],"to":[3.2,11,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-3.2,5,-3.5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,0,42,6],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,0,28,6],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[42,0,48,6],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[28,0,36,6],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,6,8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6,0,12,8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ace5d80-841c-7fd1-73e9-08f1dba27d3c"},{"name":"flat_breast#b8661f","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.8,4.8,-5],"to":[2.8,10.5,-3],"autouv":0,"color":3,"origin":[-2.8,4.8,-5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48,0,54,6],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[1